# Pairs with RestoreAdmitsOnlyNamespace. The shadow build writes every backup
# record, without the per-record admission that dead-letters a record outside
# the tenant's namespace (IBackupRestoreAdmission.Admit).
MODULE: RestoreAdmitsOnlyNamespaceSkipsAdmission
TARGET: RestoreAdmitsOnlyNamespace
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the shadow build installs every record of the backup, unadmitted
PERTURBS: Build

--- FIND
         /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![c]["new"] = IF v = "yes" THEN Admitted ELSE {}]
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: no admission.
         /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![c]["new"] = IF v = "yes" THEN Backup ELSE {}]
--- END
